000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     CEARQPH.
      *VERSION.        CEARQPHV04.
000400 AUTHOR.         C HILLES/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   8/21/87.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
      ****************************************************************
001000*D   ELECTRONIC REQUISITION APPROVALS - PATH DETERMINATION SUB-*
001100*D   PROGRAM.  THIS SUBPROGRAM WILL RETURN THE PATH NUMBER THAT*
001200*D   A SPECIFIC ITEM MATCHES, BASED ON THE CLASS, DEPARTEMENT, *
001300*D   EXPENSE CLASS, AND BUDGET NUMBER OF THE ITEM.             *
      ****************************************************************
      * CHANGES, MODIFICATIONS AND ENHANCEMENTS
      *C
      *C   MARCH 1995 - ADDED THE ABILITY TO ALLOW THE USER TO HAVE
      *C   ONE BLANK PATH IN THEIR APPROVAL PATH SETUP. THE PROGRAM
      *C   WAS PREMATURELY BEING EXITED LOOKING AT THE PATHS FOR A
      *C   MATCH WHEN THE USER WAS SPECIFYING A DEPARTMENT RANGE
      *C   IN THE APPROVAL PATH.
      *C
      *C   MAY 2001  JE COFFMAN
      *C   CHANGED BLANK PATHS COUNTER IN 7000-CHECK PATH TO BE
      *C   70 INSTEAD OF 99 AS WAS ORIGINALLY SET FOR DANVILLE.
      *C   LAWTON DOES NOT HAVE 99 EMPTY PATHS SO WHEN THE USER
      *C   WAS RETURNING A REQ TO THE ORIGINATOR AND NO DEPARTMENT
      *C   WAS PICKED UP FROM THE REQ, THE PROGRAM WENT LOOPING.
      *C
      *C   APR 2003  CA YODER
      *C   CHANGED BLANK PATHS COUNTER IN 7000-CHECK PATH TO BE
      *C   50 INSTEAD OF 70 SINCE LAWTON NO LONGER HAS 70 EMPTY
      *C   PATHS.
      *C
      *C  12/01/2004 B FONAGY  VER. - CEARQPHV04.
      *C  ****** RED BALL REQUEST SYSTEM # 2004-55492
      *C       MODIFY LOGIC TO READ SEQUENTIALLY THROUGH
      *C       'MPATH' INSTEAD OF DIRECT READ.  THE PREVIOUS
      *C       LOGIC ONLY ALLOWED FOR 50 'GAPS' BETWEEN
      *C       ACTUAL PATH NUMBERS.  IN LAWTON, WHEN THIS
      *C       OCCURED, THERE DISPLAY WOULD 'LOCK UP' AND NOT
      *C       UPDATE ANY MORE PATHS.
      *C
      *C  02/01/2005   CA YODER   REQ #: 2005-32375
      *C  CORRECTED LOGIC THAT CAUSED ADD PATHS TO BE SKIPPED WHEN
      *C  APPROVAL PATHS ARE ASSIGNED.
      *C
      *C  02/24/2005   CA YODER   REQ #: 2005-99199
      *C  CORRECTED LOGIC THAT CAUSED EXTRA APPROVALS TO BE
      *C  ADDED TO REQS FOR PLANTS THAT HAVE NO ADD PATHS DEFINED.
      *C
      *C  03/09/2005   CA YODER   REQ #: 2005-59356
      *C  MOVED LOGIC FROM PRIOR CHANGE AFTER THE END-OF-FILE
      *C  CHECKING IN PARAGRAPH 6210-CHECK-OTHER-PATH-LOOP.
      *C

001400
001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MVALIDPLTDATA-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPATHDEF-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4001
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPATHDEF-PK-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4002
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPATH-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

001900
002000 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MVALIDPLTDATA-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MVALIDPLTDATA-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1700  OF MCFLCS1701.

       FD  DPATHDEF-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPATHDEF-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4000  OF MCFLCS4001.

       FD  DPATHDEF-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPATHDEF-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS4000  OF MCFLCS4002.

       FD  MPATH-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPATH-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3900  OF MCFLCS3901.

002100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002200 77  BLANK-PATHS-CTR               PIC 99.
002300 77  SUB                           PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
002400 77  MATCHED-DPATHD                PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
002500 77  FOUND-PATH-FLAG               PIC X(1).
002600 77  ALREADY-CHECKED-FLAG          PIC X(1).
002700 77  LP-LIMIT                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
002800 77  SAVE-DEPT                     PIC X(6).
002900 77  CHECK-LOW-VALUE               PIC 9(14).
003000 77  CHECK-HIGH-VALUE              PIC 9(14).
003100 77  EXP-TEST                      PIC 9(6).
003200 77  EXP-TEST-DEC                  PIC 9(6)V9(4).
003300 77  EXP-TEST-INT                  PIC 9(6).
003400
003500 01  SAVE-LIKELY-PATH-ARRAY.
003600     05  SAVE-LIKELY-PATH OCCURS 30 TIMES PIC X(4).
003700
003800**************************************************************
003900**                                                          **
004000**            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
004100**                                                          **
004200**************************************************************
004300
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

004400 01  DSET-NAMES.
004500     05  DSET-MPATH                PIC X(16) VALUE "MPATH;".
004600     05  DSET-DPATHDEF             PIC X(16) VALUE "DPATHDEF;".
004700     05  DSET-MVALIDPLTDATA  PIC X(16) VALUE "MVALIDPLTDATA;".
004800
004900 01  MODE-AREA.
005000     05  DB-MODE                   PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 0.
005100     05  MODE1                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 1.
005200     05  MODE5                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 5.
005300     05  MODE7                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.
005400
005500 01  ALL-ITEMS                     PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
       01  PATH-SEARCH                   PIC X(16) VALUE "PATH-NUM;".
005700 01  PATH-ARG.
005800     05  PATH-ARG-PREFIX           PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
005900     05  PATH-ARG-NUMBER           PIC 9(3)  VALUE ZEROS.

006000 01  PD-KEY-SEARCH                 PIC X(7)  VALUE "PD-KEY;".
006100 01  PD-KEY-ARG.
006200     05  PD-KEY-ARG-PATH-TYPE      PIC X(1).
006300     05  PD-KEY-ARG-INC-EX         PIC X(1).
006400     05  PD-KEY-ARG-TYPE           PIC X(2).
006500     05  PD-KEY-ARG-LOW-VALUE      PIC X(14).
006600
006700 01  REQ-CHRG-ARG.
006800     05  FILLER                    PIC X(2)  VALUE "RC".
006900     05  RC-REQ-DEPT               PIC X(4).
007000     05  RC-CHRG-DEPT              PIC X(4).
007100
007200**************************************************************
007300**                                                          **
007400**           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
007500**                                                          **
007600**************************************************************
007700
007800 COPY MPATH      IN COPYLIB.
007900 COPY DPATHDEF   IN COPYLIB.
008000 COPY MVALDPLT   IN COPYLIB.
008100
008200**************************************************************
008300**                                                          **
008400**            L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N                 **
008500**                                                          **
008600**************************************************************
008700
008800 LINKAGE SECTION.
008900 01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
009000 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
009100 COPY CEARQPH    IN COPYLIB.
009200 01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
009300     05  BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1          PIC X(1).
009400     05  FILLER                    PIC X(57).
009500
009600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING          BASE
009700                                   STATUS-AREA,
009800                                   RQPH-AREA,
009900                                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
010000
010100 1000-CONTROL.
           MOVE 0 TO SUB.
           MOVE "N" TO MATCHED-DPATHD.
           OPEN INPUT MVALIDPLTDATA-I, DPATHDEF-I, MPATH-I,
             DPATHDEF-PK-I.
010200*------ THE MAIN KEY INTO THE PATHS IS DEPARTMENT.  IF REQUESTING
010300*------ AND CHARGE DEPT MATCH, NO PROBLEM, WE JUST SEARCH BY THAT
010400*------ DEPT.  IF REQ AND CHARGE DEPT DONT MATCH, WE CHECK FOR
010500*------ THE COMBINED KEY IN MVALIDPLTDATA (REQ + CHARGE DEPT).
010600*------ IF IT DOESNT EXIST, AGAIN WE GO BY CHARGE DEPT.  IF IT
010700*------ DOES EXIST, THERE ARE 3 OPTIONS:
010800*------   1.  GO BY CHARGE DEPT
010900*------   2.  GO BY REQUESTING DEPT
011000*------   3.  COMBINED PATH OF CHARGE DEPT AND REQ DEPT
011100*------ IN THE CASE OF COMBINED PATH, WE RETURN 2 PATH NUMBERS.
011200*------ THEN, 'CEAQUE' GETS BOTH AND ELIMINATES DUPLICATES.
011300
011400     MOVE SPACES                   TO   RQPH-RET-PATH-PREFIX2.
011500     MOVE ZERO                     TO   RQPH-RET-PATH-NUM2.
011600
011700     IF RQPH-REQ-DEPT = RQPH-DEPARTMENT
011800         PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X
011900     ELSE
012000         MOVE RQPH-REQ-DEPT        TO   RC-REQ-DEPT
012100         MOVE RQPH-DEPARTMENT      TO   RC-CHRG-DEPT
012200*        CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MVALIDPLTDATA, MODE7,
012300*          STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MVALIDPLTDATA,
012400*          REQ-CHRG-ARG
               MOVE REQ-CHRG-ARG TO VALDTAKEY OF MVALIDPLTDATA-REC-I
               READ MVALIDPLTDATA-I INTO BUF-MVALIDPLTDATA
                   INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               END-READ
012500         IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
012600*            ** CHARGE DEPT PATH
012700             IF VALID-DATA-DESC-1 = "1"
012800                 PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X
012900             ELSE
013000*            ** REQ DEPT PATH
013100             IF VALID-DATA-DESC-1 = "2"
013200                 MOVE RQPH-DEPARTMENT   TO   SAVE-DEPT
013300                 MOVE RQPH-REQ-DEPT     TO   RQPH-DEPARTMENT
013400                 PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X
013500                 MOVE SAVE-DEPT         TO   RQPH-DEPARTMENT
013600             ELSE
013700*            ** COMBINED PATH
013800                 PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X
013900                 MOVE RQPH-RET-PATH     TO   RQPH-RET-PATH2
014000                 MOVE RQPH-DEPARTMENT   TO   SAVE-DEPT
014100                 MOVE RQPH-REQ-DEPT     TO   RQPH-DEPARTMENT
014200                 PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X
014300                 MOVE SAVE-DEPT         TO   RQPH-DEPARTMENT
014400         ELSE
014500         IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
014600             PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X
014700     ELSE
014800         MOVE "CEARQPH DBGET ERR MVALD 1000-C" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014900         GO TO 2000-END.
015000
015100 2000-END.
           CLOSE MVALIDPLTDATA-I, DPATHDEF-I, MPATH-I, DPATHDEF-PK-I.
015200     GOBACK.
015300
015400
015500 6000-MAIN.
015600     MOVE 0                        TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER.
015700     MOVE RQPH-PATH-TYPE           TO   PATH-ARG-PREFIX.
015800
015900*------ WE WILL FIRST CHECK ANY PATHS THAT INCLUDE THE DEPARTMENT
016000*------ OF THAT REQ.  IF ONE OF THOSE MATCH, WE QUIT.  IF NOT,
016100*------ WE CHECK THE PATHS SEQUENTIALLY, BUT SKIP ANY PATHS WE
016200*------ ALREADY CHECKED.
016300 6010-FIND-LIKELY-PATHS.
016400     MOVE 0                        TO   LP-LIMIT.
016500     MOVE RQPH-PATH-TYPE           TO   PD-KEY-ARG-PATH-TYPE.
016600     MOVE "I"                      TO   PD-KEY-ARG-INC-EX.
016700     MOVE "D"                      TO   PD-KEY-ARG-TYPE.
016800     MOVE RQPH-DEPARTMENT          TO   PD-KEY-ARG-LOW-VALUE.
016900
017000*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DPATHDEF, MODE1,
017100*      STATUS-AREA, PD-KEY-SEARCH, PD-KEY-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PD-KEY-ARG TO PDKEY OF DPATHDEF-PK-REC-I.
           START DPATHDEF-PK-I KEY >= PDKEY OF DPATHDEF-PK-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
017200     IF NO-ENTRY
017300         GO TO 6200-CHECK-OTHER-PATHS
017400     ELSE
017500     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
017600         MOVE "CEARQPH DBFIND ERR 6010-FLP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
017700         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
017800
018200 6020-FIND-LIKELY-PATHS-LOOP.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPATHDEF-PK-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPATHDEF
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PDKEY OF DPATHDEF-PK-REC-I NOT = PD-KEY-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
018500     IF END-OF-CHAIN
018600         GO TO 6100-CHECK-LIKELY-PATHS
018700     ELSE
018800     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
018900         MOVE "CEARQPH DBGET ERR 6020-FLPL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
019000         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
019100
           IF DPATHD-PATH-PREFIX NOT = RQPH-PATH-TYPE
               GO TO 6020-FIND-LIKELY-PATHS-LOOP.

019200     ADD 1                         TO   LP-LIMIT.
019300     MOVE DPATHD-PATH-NUMBER TO SAVE-LIKELY-PATH (LP-LIMIT).
019400
019500     GO TO 6020-FIND-LIKELY-PATHS-LOOP.
019600
019700 6100-CHECK-LIKELY-PATHS.
019800     MOVE 0                        TO   SUB.
019900
020000 6110-CHECK-LIKELY-PATHS-LOOP.
020100     ADD 1                         TO   SUB.
020200     IF SUB > LP-LIMIT
020300         GO TO 6200-CHECK-OTHER-PATHS.
020400
020500     MOVE SAVE-LIKELY-PATH (SUB)   TO   PATH-ARG.
020600     PERFORM 7000-CHECK-PATH THRU 7090-CP-X.
020700     IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
020800         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X
020900     ELSE
021000     IF FOUND-PATH-FLAG = "Y"
021100         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X
021200     ELSE
021300         GO TO 6110-CHECK-LIKELY-PATHS-LOOP.
021400
021500 6200-CHECK-OTHER-PATHS.
      ****************************************
      *        VER. CEARQPHV04               *
      ****************************************
021600*------ NOTE: WE NEVER CHECK PATH 1, THE DEFAULT PATH.
      *    MOVE 0                        TO   BLANK-PATHS-CTR.
021700     MOVE RQPH-PATH-TYPE           TO   PATH-ARG-PREFIX.
021800*****MOVE 1                        TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER.
           MOVE 2                        TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER.
           MOVE 0                        TO   COND-WORD.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC-I.
           START MPATH-I KEY > PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD.
021900
022000 6210-CHECK-OTHER-PATH-LOOP.
022100*    ADD 1                         TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER.
022200*    PERFORM 7300-CHECK-ALREADY-CHECKED THRU 7390-CAC-X.
022300*    IF ALREADY-CHECKED-FLAG = "Y"
022400*        GO TO 6210-CHECK-OTHER-PATH-LOOP.
022500
022600*    PERFORM 7000-CHECK-PATH THRU 7090-CP-X.
022700*    IF FOUND-PATH-FLAG = "Y"
022800*        GO TO 6990-MAIN-X
022900*    ELSE
023000*        GO TO 6210-CHECK-OTHER-PATH-LOOP.

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MPATH-I NEXT INTO BUF-MPATH
               AT END MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC-I TO PATH-ARG.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               END-IF
           END-IF.
           IF END-OF-FILE
               MOVE "Y" TO FOUND-PATH-FLAG
               MOVE "Y" TO RQPH-PRINT-OPTION
               IF PATH-ARG-NUMBER = 2
                   MOVE "X" TO RQPH-RET-DEFAULT-FLAG
                   MOVE 1 TO PATH-ARG-NUMBER
                   MOVE PATH-ARG TO RQPH-RET-PATH
                   GO TO 7090-CP-X
               ELSE
                   MOVE "Y" TO RQPH-RET-DEFAULT-FLAG
                   MOVE 1 TO PATH-ARG-NUMBER
                   MOVE PATH-ARG TO RQPH-RET-PATH
                   GO TO 7090-CP-X
               END-IF
           ELSE
               IF NOT GOOD-CALL
                   MOVE "CEARQPH DBGET ERR MPATH 6200-COP"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 7090-CP-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.
           IF MPATH-PATH-NUMBER = SPACES
               GO TO 6210-CHECK-OTHER-PATH-LOOP
           END-IF.

           IF RQPH-PATH-TYPE = "A"
             IF MPATH-PATH-PREFIX NOT = RQPH-PATH-TYPE
               MOVE "X" TO RQPH-RET-DEFAULT-FLAG
               MOVE 1                TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER
               MOVE PATH-ARG         TO   RQPH-RET-PATH
               GO TO 7090-CP-X.

           PERFORM 7010-ADDTL-PATH-CHECKS THRU 7090-CP-X.
           IF FOUND-PATH-FLAG = "Y"
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X
           ELSE
               GO TO 6210-CHECK-OTHER-PATH-LOOP
           END-IF.

023100
023200 6990-MAIN-X.
023300     EXIT.
023600
023700 7000-CHECK-PATH.
           MOVE PATH-ARG TO PATHNUM OF MPATH-REC-I.
           READ MPATH-I INTO BUF-MPATH
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
024200     IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      ****************************************
      *        VER. CEARQPHV04               *
      ****************************************
               GO TO 7090-CP-X
      *        ADD 1                     TO   BLANK-PATHS-CTR
      *    UPPED BLANKS PATHS ALLOWED TO 98 TO HANDLE A DAVILLE
      *    PROBLEM 03/6/01 -- JEC
      *    ALTERED MAX EMPTY PATHS TO CHECK T0 70 ON MAY 30, 2001
      *    AS LAWTON DOES NOT HAVE 99 EMPTY PATH SLOTS.
      *    4/10/03--CHANGED NUMBER TO 50 SINCE LAWTON DOES NOT HAVE
      *    70 EMPTY PATH SLOTS.
      *        IF BLANK-PATHS-CTR < 50
      *            GO TO 7090-CP-X
      *        ELSE
024300*        ** DIDN'T FIND THE PATH, SO DEFAULT TO PATH 1. IF
024400*        ** THERE WERE NO PATHS OF THAT TYPE, RETURN 'X'
024500*        MOVE "Y"                  TO   FOUND-PATH-FLAG
024600*        MOVE "Y"                  TO   RQPH-PRINT-OPTION
024700*        IF PATH-ARG-NUMBER = 2
024800*            MOVE "X"              TO   RQPH-RET-DEFAULT-FLAG
024900*            MOVE 1                TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER
025000*            MOVE PATH-ARG         TO   RQPH-RET-PATH
025100*            GO TO 7090-CP-X
025200*        ELSE
025300*            MOVE "Y"              TO   RQPH-RET-DEFAULT-FLAG
025400*            MOVE 1                TO   PATH-ARG-NUMBER
025500*            MOVE PATH-ARG         TO   RQPH-RET-PATH
025600*            GO TO 7090-CP-X
025700     ELSE
025800     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
025900         MOVE "CEARQPH DBGET ERR 7000-CPL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
026000         GO TO 7090-CP-X.
026100
      ***************************************
      *        VER. CEARQPHV04              *
      ***************************************
       7010-ADDTL-PATH-CHECKS.
      *------ RESET BLANK PATHS COUNTER AS WE WILL ONLY ALLOW UP TO 5
      *------ BLANK PATHS IN A USER'S APPROVAL PATH STRUCTURE
           MOVE 0                        TO   BLANK-PATHS-CTR.
           MOVE "N"                      TO   FOUND-PATH-FLAG.

026200*------ IF ANY CRITERIA EXCLUDES THE ITEM FROM THIS PATH,
026300*------ SKIP BACK UP TO TRY THE NEXT PATH
026400     IF RQPH-VALUE < MPATH-MIN-VAL
026500         GO TO 7090-CP-X.
026600
026700     IF RQPH-VALUE > MPATH-MAX-VAL
026800         GO TO 7090-CP-X.
026900
027000     IF MPATH-WO-APPROVE = "Y"
027100         IF RQPH-WO-APPROVED = "N"
027200             GO TO 7090-CP-X.
027300
027400*------ NOW CHECK THE PATH DEFINITION AGAINST THE ITEMS
027500*------ DATA.  IF NO MORE PATH DEF, WE HIT A MATCH AT THIS POINT.
027600*    CALL "DBFIND" USING BASE, DSET-DPATHDEF, MODE1,
027700*      STATUS-AREA, PATH-SEARCH, PATH-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PATH-ARG TO PATHNUM OF DPATHDEF-REC-I.
           START DPATHDEF-I KEY = PATHNUM OF DPATHDEF-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
027800     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
027900         MOVE "CEARQPH DBFIND ERR DPATHDEF 7000-CPL"
028000                                   TO   BU-DISPLAY-MSG
028100         GO TO 7090-CP-X.
028200
028300*    IF CHAIN-LENG = 0
028400*        GO TO 7090-CP-X.
028500
028600 7020-CHECK-PATHDEF-LOOP.
028700*------ IF WE COME TO END OF CHAIN WITHOUT HITTING AN 'INCLUDE',
028800*------ THE ITEM DIDN'T MATCH THIS PATH.  THE FIRST 'EXCLUDE'
028900*------ WE HIT DISQUALIFIES THE ITEM.  THE CHAIN IS SORTED BY
029000*------ INCLUDE/EXCLUDE FLAG, SO ANY EXCLUDE WILL COME UP FIRST.
029100*------ THEREFORE ON THE FIRST INCLUDE WE HIT WE EXIT WITH A
029200*------ MATCH
029300*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DPATHDEF, MODE5,
029400*      STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DPATHDEF, PATH-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPATHDEF-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPATHDEF
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PATHNUM OF DPATHDEF-REC-I NOT = PATH-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
029500     IF COND-WORD = 15
029600         GO TO 7090-CP-X
029700     ELSE
029800     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
029900         MOVE "CEARQPH DBGET ERR 6110-CPL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
030000         GO TO 7090-CP-X.
030100
030200*------ IF THE HIGH VALUE IN RANGE IS SPACES, THAT MEANS THEY
030300*------ WANTED TO CHECK FOR JUST THE LOW VALUE, WHICH IS THE SAME
030400*------ AS A RANGE WITH LOW-VALUE = HIGH VALUE
030500     IF DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE = SPACES
030600         MOVE DPATHD-LOW-VALUE     TO   DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE.
030700
030800     PERFORM 7100-CHECK-DPATHDEF.
030900     IF DPATHD-INCL-EXCL-FLAG = "E"
031000         IF MATCHED-DPATHD = "N"
031100             GO TO 7020-CHECK-PATHDEF-LOOP
031200         ELSE
031300             GO TO 7090-CP-X
031400     ELSE
031500         IF MATCHED-DPATHD = "N"
031600             GO TO 7020-CHECK-PATHDEF-LOOP
031700         ELSE
031800             MOVE "Y"              TO   FOUND-PATH-FLAG
031900             MOVE MPATH-PRINT-OPTION TO  RQPH-PRINT-OPTION
032000             MOVE PATH-ARG         TO   RQPH-RET-PATH
032100             GO TO 7090-CP-X.
032200
032300 7090-CP-X.
032400     EXIT.
032500
032600******************************************************************
032700**                                                              **
032800**      P E R F O R M E D   R O U T I N E S                     **
032900**                                                              **
033000******************************************************************
033100 7100-CHECK-DPATHDEF.
033200     MOVE "N"                      TO   MATCHED-DPATHD.
033300     IF DPATHD-TYPE = "C"
033400         IF RQPH-CLASS < DPATHD-LOW-VALUE
033500             NEXT SENTENCE
033600         ELSE
033700         IF RQPH-CLASS > DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE
033800             NEXT SENTENCE
033900         ELSE
034000             MOVE "Y"              TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
034100      ELSE
034200      IF DPATHD-TYPE = "D"
034300          IF RQPH-DEPARTMENT < DPATHD-LOW-VALUE
034400             NEXT SENTENCE
034500         ELSE
034600         IF RQPH-DEPARTMENT > DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE
034700             NEXT SENTENCE
034800         ELSE
034900             MOVE "Y"              TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
035000     ELSE
035100     IF DPATHD-TYPE = "E"
035200         IF RQPH-EXPENSE-CLASS < DPATHD-LOW-VALUE
035300             NEXT SENTENCE
035400         ELSE
035500         IF RQPH-EXPENSE-CLASS > DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE
035600             NEXT SENTENCE
035700         ELSE
035800             MOVE "Y"              TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
035900     ELSE
036000     IF DPATHD-TYPE = "B"
               IF RQPH-BUD-REVNO NOT = SPACES
                   IF RQPH-BUD-REVNO < DPATHD-LOW-REVNO
                       NEXT SENTENCE
                   ELSE
                   IF RQPH-BUD-REVNO > DPATHD-HIGH-REVNO
                       NEXT SENTENCE
                   ELSE
                   MOVE "Y"              TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
               ELSE
036100         IF RQPH-BUDGET-NUMBER < DPATHD-LOW-VALUE
036200             NEXT SENTENCE
036300         ELSE
036400         IF RQPH-BUDGET-NUMBER > DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE
036500             NEXT SENTENCE
036600         ELSE
036700             MOVE "Y"              TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
036800     ELSE
036900     IF DPATHD-TYPE = "V"
037000         MOVE DPATHD-LOW-VALUE     TO   CHECK-LOW-VALUE
037100         MOVE DPATHD-HIGH-VALUE    TO   CHECK-HIGH-VALUE
037200         IF RQPH-VALUE < CHECK-LOW-VALUE
037300             NEXT SENTENCE
037400         ELSE
037500         IF RQPH-VALUE > CHECK-HIGH-VALUE
037600             NEXT SENTENCE
037700         ELSE
037800             MOVE "Y"              TO   MATCHED-DPATHD.
037900
038000*------ AN ODD-EVEN FLAG CAN BE SET FOR EXPENSE CLASSES.
038100*------ IE, IF FLAG = "E" THEN ONLY EVEN EXPENSE CLASSES
038200*------ WILL MATCH THAT DEFINITION.
038300     IF DPATHD-ODD-EVEN-FLAG = "O" OR "E"
038400         IF MATCHED-DPATHD = "Y" AND DPATHD-TYPE = "E"
038500             IF RQPH-EXP-CLS-1-6 NUMERIC
038600                 MOVE RQPH-EXP-CLS-1-6 TO EXP-TEST
038700                 DIVIDE EXP-TEST BY 2 GIVING EXP-TEST-DEC
038800                 DIVIDE EXP-TEST BY 2 GIVING EXP-TEST-INT
038900                 IF DPATHD-ODD-EVEN-FLAG = "O"
039000                     IF EXP-TEST-INT = EXP-TEST-DEC
039100                        MOVE "N"   TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
039200                     ELSE
039300                        NEXT SENTENCE
039400                 ELSE
039500                     IF EXP-TEST-INT = EXP-TEST-DEC
039600                        NEXT SENTENCE
039700                     ELSE
039800                        MOVE "N"   TO   MATCHED-DPATHD
039900             ELSE
040000                 MOVE "N"          TO   MATCHED-DPATHD.
040100
040200 7300-CHECK-ALREADY-CHECKED.
040300     MOVE "N"                      TO   ALREADY-CHECKED-FLAG.
040400     MOVE 0                        TO   SUB.
040500
040600 7310-CAC-LOOP.
040700     ADD 1                         TO   SUB.
040800     IF SUB > LP-LIMIT
040900         GO TO 7390-CAC-X.
041000
041100     IF SAVE-LIKELY-PATH (SUB) = PATH-ARG
041200         MOVE "Y"                  TO   ALREADY-CHECKED-FLAG
041300         GO TO 7390-CAC-X.
041400
041500     GO TO 7310-CAC-LOOP.
041600
041700 7390-CAC-X.
041800     EXIT.
